---
title: "Interpreter test"
---
STEP 1: GATHER
ASK "What is your name?" into {name}
Run a command with $shell_exec, passing {"command": "echo tool-ran"}, and keep its output as {out}.
List the letters a, b and c as a JSON array and call it {items}.

STEP 2: WORK
FOR EACH {it} in {items}:
    IF {it} is "b":
        Mention the letter {it}.
IF the user {name} seems happy:
    Remember happy as {mood}.
ELSE:
    Remember sad as {mood}.
RETRY 2 times:
    Read the notes with $fs_read, passing {"path": "missing.txt"}.
ASK "Pick a colour" [red, green] into {colour}

STEP 3: DONE
RETURN "Hi {name}, mood {mood}, {items.length} items, {colour}, {out}"
